        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "托鉢の鉢を手に、頭陀の行脚を続ける僧の姿は、町の人々に畏敬の念を抱かせた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "彼は悟りを開くため、家を捨てて頭陀の道に入ることを決意した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "諸国を巡る頭陀の旅の途中で、彼は多くの人々と出会い、教えを説いた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "sack",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
